# readlicense_oo — generates readme_<lang>.html and readme_<lang>.txt from
# readme.xrm (XML resource) via readme.xsl (XSLT stylesheet).
#
# The dmake build uses xsltproc.  On Windows xsltproc is not a standard tool;
# Strawberry Perl provides XML::LibXSLT but requires additional setup.  The
# localized build also requires a prior l10ntools merge step to produce the
# merged readme.xrm with translated strings.
#
# Deferred: implement once the l10ntools merge pipeline and an xsltproc wrapper
# (or Perl XML::LibXSLT genrule) are in place.
#
# Source files are under docs/readme/:
#   readme.xrm   — XML source with English strings
#   readme.xsl   — XSLT stylesheet (HTML and text modes)
#   readme.dtd   — DTD for validation
